  "sourceTitle": "Potato Bake",
  "sourceText": "Potato Bake\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 4:51am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n750 grams potatoes, peeled & sliced\n600 mls thickened cream\n35 grams French Onion soup mix\n1 cup grated cheese\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Layer potatoes in shallow dish. Combine soup & cream & pour over potatoes. Bake covered with foil for 30 mins @ 180 degrees C, remove foil, sprinkle with cheese, bake further 30 mins.",
